  141	     *
  142	     * Own, destroyed, vacationing and administrator-protected planets are all
  143	     * skipped — the module restates no rule, it only declines candidates the
  144	     * host's own mission would refuse. A planet the account already knows, or
  145	     * already has a probe travelling toward, is skipped too. Among what remains,
